Recurse and track depth. If any subtree is unbalanced (depth diff > 1), return -1 sentinel.

```python
def is_balanced(root):
    def depth(n):
        if not n:
            return 0
        l = depth(n.left)
        if l == -1:
            return -1
        r = depth(n.right)
        if r == -1 or abs(l - r) > 1:
            return -1
        return 1 + max(l, r)
    return depth(root) != -1
```

